# Local agent/editor scratch — launch configs, session state.
/.claude/

# Every shape of them, because Bun loads more than the two literal names that
# were here: `.env`, then `.env.{NODE_ENV}`, then `.env.local`. So a key left in
# `.env.production` was both read by cutver and committable, which is the pair
# of properties a secret must never have at once. An example file stays
# committable.
.env*
!.env.example